    "description": "Small heading over the last section of the backup screen, the one holding the reset button. One word, matching the verb used in backupResetProfile."
  },
  "backupResetProfile": "Reset profile",
  "@backupResetProfile": {
    "description": "The button that empties the app back to a fresh install, on Backup & restore. It names what it acts on rather than what it destroys — the dialog behind it does that."
  },
  "backupResetTitle": "Reset profile?",
